         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">General Description&#xA;This device is designed specifically for battery charge or load switching in cellular handset and other ultraportable applications. It features a MOSFET with low onâ€state resistance.&#xA;The MicroFETt 2x2 package offers exceptional thermal performance for its physical size and is well suited to linear mode applications.</rdf:li>
